# Whitelist: ignore EVERYTHING, then allow only the public web files.
# This guarantees the sensitive PDFs, roadmap, and raw assets never get published.
*
!.gitignore
!index.html
!villa.html
!logo-trim.png
!founder.png
!villas-data.js
!sitemap.xml
!robots.txt
!CNAME
!photos/
!photos/**
!build/
!build/build.py
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/build.yml
